@startuml
' author: Codex（AI助手）
' created: 2026-10-29
' updated: 2026-10-29
' status: 依据SRS v0.3工作稿的用例草案，未完成渲染或实现验证
title 推免MVP主要用例与权限
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
actor 学生 as Student
actor 管理员 as Admin
actor 评估维护者 as Evaluator
rectangle "推免个性化推荐系统" {
  usecase "确认/补充可复用画像" as Profile
  usecase "获取个性化机会推荐\n理由/政策/未知点" as Recommend
  usecase "核验候选来源并重判" as Review
  usecase "首次/新年度/全局资料更新" as Update
  usecase "查看异常告警与处理争议" as Alerts
  usecase "隔离评估/人工复标/版本比较" as Eval
}
Student --> Profile
Student --> Recommend
Recommend ..> Profile : <<include>>
Recommend ..> Review : <<include>>
Admin --> Update
Admin --> Alerts
Evaluator --> Eval
note bottom of Eval
评估是内部维护用例；不等于学生可访问
真实用户原始资料或触发全局更新。
end note
@enduml
